#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Deterministic and live token-efficiency benchmarks for llm-wiki.

The static benchmark is safe for CI and never calls a model. Provider-specific
live and pair benchmarks use Codex, Claude Code, or local DS4 through Pi.
"""

